title: ledgerkb
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Rajarshi
    family-names: Nandi
    alias: rajo69
repository-code: https://github.com/rajo69/ledgerkb
url: https://github.com/rajo69/ledgerkb
abstract: >-
  A Python library that turns scattered documents into an append-only,
  bitemporal ledger of evidence-bearing assertions. The retrieval index, the
  knowledge graph, a portable wiki export, a briefing document and a change
  report are projections of that one ledger rather than separate subsystems.
  Runs with no API key and no network.
keywords:
  - knowledge-base
  - retrieval-augmented-generation
  - knowledge-graph
  - bitemporal
  - provenance
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.0.1
